      "content": "Thanks! I like the vibe. But I'm worried about the comments section... we might get some pushback from people saying that focusing on \"traditional\" structures is exclusionary or outdated. How should I respond to those comments if they pop up? I want to defend the post without sounding like I'm attacking other family types.",
